venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# news.db is deliberately NOT ignored. The scheduled draw runs on a fresh
# GitHub runner each time, so the database is the only thing carrying dedup
# history between editions -- ignore it and the paper repeats itself. fetch.py
# prunes it to stay small.

# The spec is kept LOCAL and out of the repo (Frank's call, Aug 23 2026). This
# repository is public, and while the spec holds no credentials it does name
# personal subscriptions and interests. Ignored rather than merely uncommitted,
# so a later `git add -A` cannot sweep it up by accident.
news-aggregator-spec.md
